{"id":"1d4177d202e67eb5","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-diaconescu.md","title":"Theorem — Diaconescu：内部选择推出布尔性","display":"Theorem — Diaconescu：内部选择推出布尔性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-diaconescu","aliases":["14-thm-diaconescu"],"display":"Theorem — Diaconescu：内部选择推出布尔性","source_ref":"VI.1 p.275; VI exercises Exercise16(a)–(e), p.346, DjVu179 left","source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。","verification_status":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked","depends_on":["[[14-df-choice-axioms]]","[[14-thm-internal-choice-local-sections]]","[[14-thm-double-copy-gluing-complement]]","[[14-df-boolean-topos]]","[[14-df-heyting-negation]]","[[14-df-subobject-quantifiers]]","[[14-thm-elementary-topos-finite-colimits]]","[[14-thm-topos-image-factorization-and-regularity]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-diaconescu"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-diaconescu</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — Diaconescu：内部选择推出布尔性"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"VI.1 p.275; VI exercises Exercise16(a)–(e), p.346, DjVu179 left"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cba7e4db2a363792\" href=\"?note=cba7e4db2a363792\" title=\"14-df-choice-axioms\">14-df-choice-axioms</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4fb22144b0e10ac9\" href=\"?note=4fb22144b0e10ac9\" title=\"14-thm-internal-choice-local-sections\">14-thm-internal-choice-local-sections</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ba35738413a412b8\" href=\"?note=ba35738413a412b8\" title=\"14-thm-double-copy-gluing-complement\">14-thm-double-copy-gluing-complement</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"78d84752064c9948\" href=\"?note=78d84752064c9948\" title=\"14-df-boolean-topos\">14-df-boolean-topos</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"42b2e2d4b9f8fe9c\" href=\"?note=42b2e2d4b9f8fe9c\" title=\"14-df-heyting-negation\">14-df-heyting-negation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0b6a2f7cb930ac02\" href=\"?note=0b6a2f7cb930ac02\" title=\"14-df-subobject-quantifiers\">14-df-subobject-quantifiers</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"4f584a450845e8d6\" href=\"?note=4f584a450845e8d6\" title=\"14-thm-elementary-topos-finite-colimits\">14-thm-elementary-topos-finite-colimits</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"4cd3b0d29b80beda\" href=\"?note=4cd3b0d29b80beda\" title=\"14-thm-topos-image-factorization-and-regularity\">14-thm-topos-image-factorization-and-regularity</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 为初等拓扑斯，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IAC}\">\\(\\operatorname{IAC}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AC}\">\\(\\operatorname{AC}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"cba7e4db2a363792\" href=\"?note=cba7e4db2a363792\" title=\"14-df-choice-axioms\">14-df-choice-axioms</a>；布尔性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"78d84752064c9948\" href=\"?note=78d84752064c9948\" title=\"14-df-boolean-topos\">14-df-boolean-topos</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Neg}_X\">\\(\\mathrm{Neg}_X\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"42b2e2d4b9f8fe9c\" href=\"?note=42b2e2d4b9f8fe9c\" title=\"14-df-heyting-negation\">14-df-heyting-negation</a> 的子对象伪补。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IAC}(\\mathcal E)\\Rightarrow\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X)\\quad A\\vee_X\\mathrm{Neg}_X(A)=\\top_X.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{IAC}(\\mathcal E)\\Rightarrow\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X)\\quad A\\vee_X\\mathrm{Neg}_X(A)=\\top_X.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IAC}(\\mathcal E)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{IsBoolean}(\\mathcal E),\\qquad \\operatorname{AC}(\\mathcal E)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{IsBoolean}(\\mathcal E).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{IAC}(\\mathcal E)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{IsBoolean}(\\mathcal E),\\qquad \\operatorname{AC}(\\mathcal E)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{IsBoolean}(\\mathcal E).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源说明：以下来源定位与历史核对经历为所附原稿的记录；本次核对对象为本对话提供的数学笔记。</p>\n<p>原书 VI.1 印刷 p.275 提及结论；完整任务分解是 VI 练习16(a)–(e)，p.346，DjVu179 左页图像已核对。p.275 的“Exercise15”是该版本的编号偏差，不能据此引用15作为代数证明。</p>\n<p>固定任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m:A\\hookrightarrow X\">\\(m:A\\hookrightarrow X\\)</span>，取<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"ba35738413a412b8\" href=\"?note=ba35738413a412b8\" title=\"14-thm-double-copy-gluing-complement\">14-thm-double-copy-gluing-complement</a>的胶合满态射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q:X+X\\twoheadrightarrow Q\">\\(q:X+X\\twoheadrightarrow Q\\)</span>。<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"4fb22144b0e10ac9\" href=\"?note=4fb22144b0e10ac9\" title=\"14-thm-internal-choice-local-sections\">14-thm-internal-choice-local-sections</a>给覆盖 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e:U\\twoheadrightarrow1\">\\(e:U\\twoheadrightarrow1\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\times1_U\">\\(q\\times1_U\\)</span> 有截面。乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 是指数函子的左伴随，因而保持该余等化子及余积；故<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"ba35738413a412b8\" href=\"?note=ba35738413a412b8\" title=\"14-thm-double-copy-gluing-complement\">14-thm-double-copy-gluing-complement</a>应用于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\times1_U:A\\times U\\hookrightarrow X\\times U\">\\(m\\times1_U:A\\times U\\hookrightarrow X\\times U\\)</span>，得到这个拉回子对象可补，即满足排中律。</p>\n<p>投影 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:X\\times U\\twoheadrightarrow X\">\\(p:X\\times U\\twoheadrightarrow X\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 的拉回。拓扑斯的子对象逆像保持交、并、蕴涵及底，因此保持伪补。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p^{-1}(A\\vee\\mathrm{Neg}_X A)=\\top_{X\\times U}\">\\(p^{-1}(A\\vee\\mathrm{Neg}_X A)=\\top_{X\\times U}\\)</span>。沿满态射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 比较特征映射并右消去，得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\vee\\mathrm{Neg}_X A=\\top_X\">\\(A\\vee\\mathrm{Neg}_X A=\\top_X\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,A\">\\(X,A\\)</span> 任意，所以每一个子对象代数都布尔；论证没有仅检查全局真值。最后由<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"cba7e4db2a363792\" href=\"?note=cba7e4db2a363792\" title=\"14-df-choice-axioms\">14-df-choice-axioms</a>的 AC 推出 IAC 得第二结论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-choice-axioms","status":"resolved","id":"cba7e4db2a363792","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-choice-axioms]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-internal-choice-local-sections","status":"resolved","id":"4fb22144b0e10ac9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-internal-choice-local-sections]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-double-copy-gluing-complement","status":"resolved","id":"ba35738413a412b8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-double-copy-gluing-complement]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-boolean-topos","status":"resolved","id":"78d84752064c9948","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-boolean-topos]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-heyting-negation","status":"resolved","id":"42b2e2d4b9f8fe9c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-heyting-negation]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-subobject-quantifiers","status":"resolved","id":"0b6a2f7cb930ac02","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-subobject-quantifiers]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-elementary-topos-finite-colimits","status":"resolved","id":"4f584a450845e8d6","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-elementary-topos-finite-colimits]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-topos-image-factorization-and-regularity","status":"resolved","id":"4cd3b0d29b80beda","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-topos-image-factorization-and-regularity]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-choice-axioms","status":"resolved","id":"cba7e4db2a363792","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为初等拓扑斯，$\\operatorname{IAC}$ 与 $\\operatorname{AC}$ 见 [[14-df-choice-axioms]]；布尔性见 [[14-df-boolean-topos]]，$\\mathrm{Neg}_X$ 是 [[14-df-heyting-negation]] 的子对象伪补。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-boolean-topos","status":"resolved","id":"78d84752064c9948","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为初等拓扑斯，$\\operatorname{IAC}$ 与 $\\operatorname{AC}$ 见 [[14-df-choice-axioms]]；布尔性见 [[14-df-boolean-topos]]，$\\mathrm{Neg}_X$ 是 [[14-df-heyting-negation]] 的子对象伪补。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-heyting-negation","status":"resolved","id":"42b2e2d4b9f8fe9c","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为初等拓扑斯，$\\operatorname{IAC}$ 与 $\\operatorname{AC}$ 见 [[14-df-choice-axioms]]；布尔性见 [[14-df-boolean-topos]]，$\\mathrm{Neg}_X$ 是 [[14-df-heyting-negation]] 的子对象伪补。","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-double-copy-gluing-complement","status":"resolved","id":"ba35738413a412b8","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"固定任意 $m:A\\hookrightarrow X$，取[[14-thm-double-copy-gluing-complement]]的胶合满态射 $q:X+X\\twoheadrightarrow Q$。[[14-thm-internal-choice-local-sections]]给覆盖 $e:U\\twoheadrightarrow1$，使 $q\\times1_U$ 有截面。乘以 $U$ 是指数函子的左伴随，因而保持该余等化子及余积；故[[14-thm-double-copy-gluing-complement]]应用于 $m\\times1_U:A\\times U\\hookrightarrow X\\times U$，得到这个拉回子对象可补，即满足排中律。","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-internal-choice-local-sections","status":"resolved","id":"4fb22144b0e10ac9","anchor":"ref-13","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"固定任意 $m:A\\hookrightarrow X$，取[[14-thm-double-copy-gluing-complement]]的胶合满态射 $q:X+X\\twoheadrightarrow Q$。[[14-thm-internal-choice-local-sections]]给覆盖 $e:U\\twoheadrightarrow1$，使 $q\\times1_U$ 有截面。乘以 $U$ 是指数函子的左伴随，因而保持该余等化子及余积；故[[14-thm-double-copy-gluing-complement]]应用于 $m\\times1_U:A\\times U\\hookrightarrow X\\times U$，得到这个拉回子对象可补，即满足排中律。","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-double-copy-gluing-complement","status":"resolved","id":"ba35738413a412b8","anchor":"ref-14","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"固定任意 $m:A\\hookrightarrow X$，取[[14-thm-double-copy-gluing-complement]]的胶合满态射 $q:X+X\\twoheadrightarrow Q$。[[14-thm-internal-choice-local-sections]]给覆盖 $e:U\\twoheadrightarrow1$，使 $q\\times1_U$ 有截面。乘以 $U$ 是指数函子的左伴随，因而保持该余等化子及余积；故[[14-thm-double-copy-gluing-complement]]应用于 $m\\times1_U:A\\times U\\hookrightarrow X\\times U$，得到这个拉回子对象可补，即满足排中律。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-choice-axioms","status":"resolved","id":"cba7e4db2a363792","anchor":"ref-15","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"投影 $p:X\\times U\\twoheadrightarrow X$ 是 $e$ 的拉回。拓扑斯的子对象逆像保持交、并、蕴涵及底，因此保持伪补。于是 $p^{-1}(A\\vee\\mathrm{Neg}_X A)=\\top_{X\\times U}$。沿满态射 $p$ 比较特征映射并右消去，得 $A\\vee\\mathrm{Neg}_X A=\\top_X$。$X,A$ 任意，所以每一个子对象代数都布尔；论证没有仅检查全局真值。最后由[[14-df-choice-axioms]]的 AC 推出 IAC 得第二结论。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IAC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{AC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Neg}_X","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IAC}(\\mathcal E)\\Rightarrow\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X)\\quad A\\vee_X\\mathrm{Neg}_X(A)=\\top_X.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IAC}(\\mathcal E)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{IsBoolean}(\\mathcal E),\\qquad \\operatorname{AC}(\\mathcal E)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{IsBoolean}(\\mathcal E).","display":true},{"tex":"m:A\\hookrightarrow X","display":false},{"tex":"q:X+X\\twoheadrightarrow Q","display":false},{"tex":"e:U\\twoheadrightarrow1","display":false},{"tex":"q\\times1_U","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"m\\times1_U:A\\times U\\hookrightarrow X\\times U","display":false},{"tex":"p:X\\times U\\twoheadrightarrow X","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"p^{-1}(A\\vee\\mathrm{Neg}_X A)=\\top_{X\\times U}","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"A\\vee\\mathrm{Neg}_X A=\\top_X","display":false},{"tex":"X,A","display":false}],"bytes":2766,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-160","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-diaconescu|thm-248 — Diaconescu：内部选择推出布尔性]]"},{"i